<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Staples buy reiterated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Staples buy reiterated.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furman Selz LLC reiterated a buy rating Tuesday on Staples Inc.</p>
<p>-- Forecast the office supply retailer's earnings would rise robustly despite a judge's ruling Monday that was expected to kill its proposed merger with rival Office Depot Inc.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Kimberly Walin said Staples earnings would rise by about 30 percent during the next two to three years without the merger.</p>
</text>
